menu "Air purifier"

config PURIFIER_HOST
    string "Purifier IPv4 address"
    default ""
    help
        Set in sdkconfig.defaults.local (gitignored). Find it with a CoAP sync probe
        across the LAN: the purifier does not answer ping.

config PURIFIER_PORT
    int "CoAP port"
    default 5683

config PURIFIER_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "Sync reply timeout (ms)"
    default 12000
    help
        Measured 2026-09-27 on an AC2220: replies took 0.2 to 7 s from a Mac, and one
        first status took 16.7 s from the XIAO.

endmenu
